    D --> G[Improved Maintainability]
```

---

## Outcome

The infrastructure became easier to understand and maintain.

The reorganisation delivered several long-term benefits:

- Clear separation between user data and application services.
- More predictable permissions and ownership.
- Easier collaboration between administrators.
- Better foundation for CI/CD automation.
- Infrastructure that follows common Linux server practices.

Although the migration itself was relatively small, it significantly improved the maintainability of the production environment.

